        "name": "DogeDesigner",
        "text": "Tesla helped save a man from jail.\n\nKevin Finley was arrested at gunpoint for allegedly fleeing police. His Tesla captured the key moments, showing why he never saw the unmarked police car.\n\nNearly two years later, the judge watched the video and found him not guilty.",
