      "text": "Amazing.\n\nEverybody is sleeping on how important this is. For all of us!\n\nFor a relatively very small additional cost, we could add in a few dozen stations and get rid of a lot of traffic in Austin, too. This is key for growing business but also the cultural / music scene, etc.",
