            "width": 1280
          }
        ],
        "name": "atlas",
        "text": "\"i think X is better now than ever\" - @TaylorLorenz \n\n\"twitter was falling apart so i'm glad @elonmusk took over but i was like elon has never ran a social media product\"\n\n\"he banned me by the way. first major mistake\"\n\n\"i was very skeptical and i thought this would be the end of X but my controversial take now is that X is better than ever. especially for technology and for the cultural conversation\"\n\n\"we got jensen tweeting, we got zuck back on. they have all come crawling back\"",
